{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Z26hkHNnNa1793152554.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美軍南方司令部表示，在東太平洋打擊所謂「運毒船」，導致船上五人死亡。</p><p></p><p>美軍西半球聯合特遣部隊在南方司令部指揮下，對一艘在東太平洋既定販毒路線上活動的快艇實施打擊，打死五名毒品恐怖分子。</p><p></p><p>美軍自去年9月起，多次對在加勒比海和東太平洋的所謂「運毒船」進行打擊，據報至今已造成235人死亡，但美方一直未公布任何證明攻擊目標涉販毒的證據。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:23.984729+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.038105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:58:18.025200+00:00","content_hash":"29ffca16ea313416fb1de00c5bb294a92b8c4ed7e2b463f6a5f70bcd66f73c3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:23.984729+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}